From 41538eda808de6568ed90a94869a973e4c07b960 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 10:08:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Restructure homepage into Research / Essays & Ideas / Life
 topic sections

- Homepage now shows three curated topic columns (featured post +
  compact list + view-all link) instead of a paginated feed
- Add /research/, /ideas/, /life/ archive pages with a reusable
  topic layout that lists every post in that topic
- Add topic front matter to existing English posts
- Replace auto-generated navigation with _data/navigation.yml for
  a deliberate, stable menu order
- Create /about/ page (Background, Research interests, Teaching,
  Collaboration & services) incorporating the Service content;
  this also fixes the post-author links that pointed to /about/
- New _home-topics.scss partial; existing _home-featured.scss left
  intact for easy rollback

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LeTTftt337G23ZYu9B2GUA
